WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:30.583
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:32.291
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.291 --> 00:00:35.375
shed light on the importance of devotion.

4
00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:37.583
Now in this verse, Lord Krishna

5
00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:41.583
describes the results of 
different types of worship.

6
00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.083
He makes clear

7
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:46.333
that the fruits of worshipping
the devas, the ancestors, spirits,

8
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:49.583
and Lord Krishna Himself

9
00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:51.416
are all different.

10
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.958
This verse shows

11
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.500
that the goal of worship itself

12
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.125
determines our destination,

13
00:00:57.125 --> 00:00:58.375
and all paths

14
00:00:58.375 --> 00:01:01.166
do not lead to the same result.

15
00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:07.750
Lord Krishna explains

16
00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:10.416
that worshippers reach those

17
00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:12.291
whom they worship.

18
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:15.458
Just as those who worship the devas

19
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:17.666
reach the realms of the devas,

20
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:19.625
those who honour their ancestors

21
00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:22.625
reach the realm of their forefathers,

22
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:25.583
and those who practise the worship of spirits

23
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:29.125
are drawn toward such existences themselves,

24
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.750
and those who with devotion

25
00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.916
worship Lord Krishna

26
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:34.708
attain Him,

27
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:37.500
and in His eternal spiritual abode

28
00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.958
reside with Him.

29
00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:43.583
This verse makes clear that
the result of worship

30
00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:45.000
depends on the worshipper's focus

31
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.625
and intention.

32
00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:50.875
The worship of the devas or ancestors

33
00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:53.208
may yield temporary material rewards,

34
00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:55.916
but this destination is not eternal,

35
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:59.291
because the devas themselves
are within the material world

36
00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:01.500
and are subject to time,

37
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.125
so their realms too are temporary.

38
00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:07.166
On the other hand, the worship of Lord Krishna

39
00:02:07.166 --> 00:02:10.500
leads to His eternal, indestructible abode.

40
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.458
Lord Krishna's devotees, in His presence,

41
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:15.041
experience eternal joy,

42
00:02:15.041 --> 00:02:19.166
freed from the cycle of birth and death.

43
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:21.500
Lord Krishna emphasises

44
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.000
that not all paths are equal.

45
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.333
The worship of the devas or spirits

46
00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:28.000
may give results,

47
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:28.791
but

48
00:02:28.791 --> 00:02:32.333
those results are limited and temporary.

49
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:35.416
Whereas the worship of
Lord Krishna brings the highest

50
00:02:35.416 --> 00:02:38.375
and most lasting result.

51
00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:41.333
Here it is also important to understand that

52
00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:43.333
this verse also reveals the principle of free will

53
00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:47.333
and personal choice.

54
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.458
Lord Krishna does not

55
00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:51.500
compel anyone to worship Him.

56
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.708
He allows every soul

57
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:56.458
to follow their own desires.

58
00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:57.666
But yes,

59
00:02:57.666 --> 00:03:00.875
with love, He does encourage everyone

60
00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:04.500
to worship Him and choose the eternal,

61
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.791
supreme destination.

62
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.500
Wherever your mind is drawn,

63
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.875
your life too begins to flow

64
00:03:16.875 --> 00:03:20.000
in that direction.

65
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.250
The goal you deeply

66
00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.750
focus on

67
00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:29.250
shapes not just your actions,

68
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:32.791
but also your destiny.

69
00:03:32.791 --> 00:03:35.500
This is the nature of the mind.

70
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.791
Wherever attention goes,

71
00:03:37.791 --> 00:03:41.750
there the current of life flows.

72
00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:45.416
If your mind is absorbed in
momentary pleasures,

73
00:03:45.416 --> 00:03:49.500
like wealth, fame, or material success,

74
00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:53.000
then your life too will naturally

75
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.541
revolve around those things,

76
00:03:56.541 --> 00:03:59.125
and your satisfaction too

77
00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:02.708
will remain just as fleeting.

78
00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:05.166
Understand it this way –

79
00:04:05.166 --> 00:04:08.791
a farmer reaps what he sows.

80
00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:11.625
The same crop he harvests.

81
00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:15.083
A skilled farmer, recognising the crop's nature,

82
00:04:15.083 --> 00:04:18.000
the soil, and the climate,

83
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.083
sows accordingly

84
00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:23.166
and works with care,

85
00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:26.666
and in time receives the right harvest.

86
00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.916
In the same way, a person

87
00:04:28.916 --> 00:04:30.500
who remains constantly engaged

88
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.416
in the practice of self-knowledge, ultimately

89
00:04:34.416 --> 00:04:35.791
attains spiritual peace

90
00:04:35.791 --> 00:04:39.083
and true joy.

91
00:04:39.083 --> 00:04:40.666
Whereas the person

92
00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:43.166
who is only concerned with good food

93
00:04:43.166 --> 00:04:45.875
and comfort,

94
00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:48.208
finds momentary pleasure,

95
00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:52.291
but not deep satisfaction.

96
00:04:52.291 --> 00:04:54.291
The essence is this –

97
00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:57.625
as the mind, so the life.

98
00:04:57.625 --> 00:05:01.541
Material desires bring limited results.

99
00:05:01.541 --> 00:05:04.500
Worshipping the devas or ancestors

100
00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.166
gives temporary rewards.

101
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:10.833
But when the mind rests in Me,

102
00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:13.166
life becomes joyful.

103
00:05:13.166 --> 00:05:14.625
These material pleasures

104
00:05:14.625 --> 00:05:18.541
fade quickly, but

105
00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:22.208
the joy that comes from fixing the mind on Me

106
00:05:22.208 --> 00:05:25.958
is eternal, it remains always,

107
00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.583
and gives infinite peace.

108
00:05:33.291 --> 00:05:35.541
Think –

109
00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:39.250
in which direction are you guiding

110
00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:43.041
your family members?

111
00:05:43.041 --> 00:05:45.750
As an elder in the family,

112
00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.250
you are a source of guidance

113
00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.833
and inspiration,

114
00:05:51.833 --> 00:05:55.583
but it is very important to understand

115
00:05:55.583 --> 00:06:00.083
that every person, even your children,

116
00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:03.458
walks their own life journey.

117
00:06:03.458 --> 00:06:05.041
Just as I

118
00:06:05.041 --> 00:06:06.000
never

119
00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.875
control anyone's choices,

120
00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:11.250
just as I

121
00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:14.666
only make the laws of life

122
00:06:14.666 --> 00:06:16.125
clear,

123
00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:19.791
explain the results of different paths,

124
00:06:19.791 --> 00:06:23.708
and then based on their choices

125
00:06:23.708 --> 00:06:27.083
give blessings or teachings,

126
00:06:27.083 --> 00:06:30.166
in the same way, you too

127
00:06:30.166 --> 00:06:33.625
must remain only in the role of a guide.

128
00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:34.958
As a parent

129
00:06:34.958 --> 00:06:38.750
or elder, your role

130
00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:44.333
is not to control every step
of those younger than you,

131
00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:46.708
but to give them a strong foundation

132
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:50.125
of values, and to show them clear boundaries

133
00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:52.666
so that they can

134
00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:57.291
take their own decisions wisely.

135
00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:59.291
When you establish

136
00:06:59.291 --> 00:07:03.041
the sense of right and wrong,

137
00:07:03.041 --> 00:07:05.166
and encourage them

138
00:07:05.166 --> 00:07:08.708
to make thoughtful decisions,

139
00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:10.791
then they learn responsibility

140
00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:13.458
and independence.

141
00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:19.000
Trying to control every aspect of someone's life

142
00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.708
can be painful for both of you.

143
00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:26.541
When you trust their judgement,

144
00:07:26.541 --> 00:07:29.500
and when needed, with humility

145
00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.500
offer them guidance too,

146
00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:36.291
then you create a very good atmosphere

147
00:07:36.291 --> 00:07:41.958
that makes family relationships
strong and warm, both.

148
00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:50.875
Have you ever asked yourself the question –

149
00:07:50.875 --> 00:07:54.750
what is the ultimate goal of my work?

150
00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.583
In the professional world, just as in life,

151
00:07:58.583 --> 00:08:01.500
the future you build

152
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:05.333
takes shape from your actions today.

153
00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:08.000
Your goal and effort today

154
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.583
determine your destination tomorrow.

155
00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:12.833
So

156
00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:16.791
choose your goal with care.

157
00:08:16.791 --> 00:08:20.125
If you are dedicated to excellence, integrity,

158
00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:23.666
and consistent hard work,

159
00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:28.041
then the results will certainly
reflect that dedication.

160
00:08:28.041 --> 00:08:29.000
But

161
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.916
if your energy is scattered, or seeks quick gains

162
00:08:32.916 --> 00:08:36.583
and shallow achievements,

163
00:08:36.583 --> 00:08:39.791
then the results too will be just as fleeting

164
00:08:39.791 --> 00:08:43.041
and limited.

165
00:08:43.041 --> 00:08:45.416
Your professional life

166
00:08:45.416 --> 00:08:49.000
is a mirror that shows

167
00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.375
your inner state.

168
00:08:50.375 --> 00:08:54.125
The quality of your effort and your steady growth

169
00:08:54.125 --> 00:08:55.708
determine

170
00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:59.000
what kind of success you will find.

171
00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.541
When you direct your actions

172
00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:05.416
toward long-term goals,

173
00:09:05.416 --> 00:09:06.958
and in meaningful work

174
00:09:06.958 --> 00:09:08.958
invest your focus,

175
00:09:08.958 --> 00:09:12.625
then you live a professional life

176
00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:16.500
that gives you strength and fulfilment.

177
00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.458
And this is the same fulfilment

178
00:09:18.458 --> 00:09:22.333
that comes from reaching My eternal abode.
